The server fell to his knees before him. He begged, saying, "Give me time, we will return everything to you."
The master felt pity for him. He forgave him the debt he owed him and let him go.
But then that servant went out and found one of the other servants who owed him a few dollars. He seized him and began to strangle him. And he said to him: "Give me back the money you owe me!"
"The other servant fell on his knees. "Give me time," he pleaded, saying, "and I will pay you back."
The first servant refused. Instead, he went and had the man thrown into prison. He would be held there until he could repay what he owed.
